WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.393
In tutorial 4.4, you'll get a researched,
quality-checked page for one keyword,

00:00:11.443 --> 00:00:12.567
ready to publish.

00:00:13.607 --> 00:00:17.387
First, click Start on Write
a page, in Run an analysis.

00:00:17.437 --> 00:00:19.827
Then type the keyword
the page should rank for.

00:00:21.111 --> 00:00:25.986
Next, choose the page type, like a
service page, a guide or a hub page.

00:00:26.036 --> 00:00:28.712
A local page asks for the city or area.

00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:33.032
To improve a page you already
have, paste its address.

00:00:33.082 --> 00:00:36.434
Or tick the box, to check
for an existing page first.

00:00:37.448 --> 00:00:41.373
And if you already have a page for
that keyword, Alaventra warns you,

00:00:41.423 --> 00:00:43.514
so two of your pages don't compete.

00:00:44.948 --> 00:00:49.136
Then choose what you get: the keyword
report, the finished page, or both.

00:00:51.452 --> 00:00:54.877
Now check the tone, the
goal and the call to action.

00:00:54.927 --> 00:00:58.068
Business facts help the page
say real things about you.

00:00:59.427 --> 00:01:03.295
You can also add a video and its
transcript, to show it on the page.

00:01:05.423 --> 00:01:07.973
The Summary shows the
credits and the time.

00:01:08.023 --> 00:01:10.938
Click Write the page, and you
can leave while it's written.

00:01:12.902 --> 00:01:17.277
When it's ready, your page report shows
the content score, the quality check,

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:19.142
and every file to download.

00:01:20.948 --> 00:01:25.542
A checklist shows what's ready on the
page, like its title, headings and links.

00:01:27.402 --> 00:01:29.652
Preview the page the way readers see it,

00:01:29.702 --> 00:01:33.066
or copy its HTML and
Markdown for your website.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:37.652
Once it's live on your site,
click I published this page,

00:01:37.702 --> 00:01:40.343
so Alaventra checks it
and tracks its position.

00:01:41.948 --> 00:01:46.618
So, type the keyword and page type, choose
what you get, check the voice and facts,

00:01:46.668 --> 00:01:47.849
and write the page.

00:01:48.948 --> 00:01:55.419
Your page is on its way. Next, follow a
run and open its reports, in tutorial 4.5.
